WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with knees bent, feet flat on the floor.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bring the soles of the feet together and let the knees fall open like a book.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Support each outer thigh with a pillow or block so there is no strain.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Rest one hand on the heart and one on the belly, or let the arms fall open.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay as long as you like; to exit, use the hands to draw the knees together.
